  "term": "dorsolateral",
  "definition": "In this context, dorsolateral refers to the dorsolateral prefrontal cortex, a prefrontal brain region. The packet describes this region as important for cognitive-motor integration because it exerts top-down regulation over the primary motor cortex.",
